<title>USA: U.S. Robotics Corp Q4 Sept 30 net higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. Robotics Corp Q4 Sept 30 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.71		  $  0.37</p>
<p> Net			 67,472		   34,219</p>
<p> Revs		     611,410		  293,397</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  95,681		   91,717</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 net excludes $54 million charge for purchases of process technology.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			$  2.36		   $ 1.05</p>
<p> Net			224,020		   89,154</p>
<p> Revs		   1,977,512		  889,347</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  94,932		   85,304</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year net excludes purchased in process technology charge of $54 million.</p>
<p>1995 year net excludes non-recurring merger costs of $29.4 million.</p>
<p>All per share results adjusted for two-for-one stock splits paid on September 8, 1995 and May 10, 1996.</p>
